This game began well; turn 2 handed me a pair of speed boots, and there
was an altar on dlvl 1.  With a few additional spells, Magicbane, and a
couple magic markers, I was in good shape the entire game.  Fort Ludios
(found via magic mapping spell) left me with gray dragon scales, which
soon became my endgame armor.  The gold was more than enough to get my
base AC down to 0.  #enhancing attack spells to Expert made fireball a
dangerous spell, and praying got me +oDeath. Writing the +of Identify
was mostly for convenience, and +of Cancellation kept me in good supply
of holy water.  I used 1 wish, for a helm of brilliance.

Hardest part was Orcus' lair, where both Orcus and Demogorgon decided
to appear next to me; I managed to isolate them on different Dlvls and
take them out individually.

MagicMapping & ^T teleporting made Gehennom a cakewalk, and so I
breezed through hell and the endgame.  First altar I picked was
chaotic, and that's how it ended!

